## REFACTOR DE SEGURIDAD OWASP (PRODUCCIÓN)
### Objetivo: Cumplimiento OWASP 95%+ para deployment producción
**Referencias:** 
- OWASP Session Management Cheat Sheet 2025
- OWASP HTML5 Security Cheat Sheet 2025
- OWASP A04:2021 Insecure Design

### Fase 1: Reducir PII en authStore (CRÍTICO)
**Problema:** sessionStorage almacena PII vulnerable a XSS
- [ ] Crear types: MinimalUser interface (id, initials, type, isVerified)
- [ ] Refactor authStore: Cambiar AdminUser/ClientUser por MinimalUser
- [ ] Backend: Crear helper calculateInitials(name: string) en loginAdmin/loginClient
- [ ] Frontend: Crear hook useUserProfile() para fetch on-demand de datos sensibles
- [ ] Migrar AdminNav: user.email → useUserProfile()
- [ ] Migrar UserMenu: user.name/email → useUserProfile()
- [ ] Migrar admin/ProfilePage: user.email → useUserProfile()
- [ ] Migrar admin/DashboardPage: user.email → useUserProfile()
- [ ] Migrar ChangePasswordPage: user.googleId → useUserProfile()
- [ ] Migrar ChangeEmailPage: user.googleId → useUserProfile()
- [ ] Migrar ResendVerificationPage: Verificar uso de user.email
- [ ] Testing: Verificar avatars, profile pages, logout flows
- **Justificación OWASP:** "Do not store session identifiers or PII in storage accessible by JavaScript"

### Fase 2: CSP Headers Backend (CRÍTICO)
- [ ] Backend: Instalar helmet middleware `pnpm add helmet`
- [ ] Backend: Configurar CSP en server.ts antes de routes
- [ ] CSP: default-src 'self'
- [ ] CSP: script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com
- [ ] CSP: style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'
- [ ] CSP: img-src 'self' data: https:
- [ ] CSP: connect-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com
- [ ] CSP: frame-src https://accounts.google.com (Google OAuth)
- [ ] Testing: Verificar Google OAuth sigue funcionando
- **Justificación OWASP:** "Use CSP to prevent XSS and data injection attacks"

### Fase 3: Input Sanitization (ALTO)
- [ ] Frontend: Instalar DOMPurify `pnpm add dompurify @types/dompurify`
- [ ] Crear utils/sanitize.ts con helpers
- [ ] Sanitizar email inputs (RegisterPage, LoginPage, ChangeEmailPage)
- [ ] Sanitizar phone inputs (RegisterPage)
- [ ] Sanitizar name inputs (RegisterPage)
- [ ] Validar regex estrictas (email, phone)
- [ ] Testing: Intentar inputs maliciosos (<script>, SQL injection patterns)
- **Justificación OWASP:** "Validate all user input before processing"

### Fase 4: Logging y Monitoreo (MEDIO)
- [ ] Backend: Log accesos a /auth/profile (detectar scraping)
- [ ] Backend: Log cambios de email/password (audit trail)
- [ ] Frontend: Error boundary con Sentry/LogRocket (opcional)
- **Justificación OWASP:** "Log security-relevant events for incident response"

